        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wood chips, burned in cogen 300kWth</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wood chips, burned in cogen 300kWth
Inventory for 1 MJ wood chips, burned in a cogeneration plant with a capacity of 300 kWth. This inventory reflects the unallocated process of burning natural gas in a cogen unit with all necessary inputs and emissions. Efficiency of the cogen unit as well allocation is not yet considered;
UUID: 0ca6e3da-e5f6-3a0a-ab6a-1e2209ce5352
The module includes fuel input from (CH) network, infrastructure (cogeneration plant), emissions to air and water, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average technology available on the market
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0ca6e3da-e5f6-3a0a-ab6a-1e2209ce5352.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
